## Demo moment — literal video script

> **Required by `demo-moment-critic`.** Write this as a literal 10-second video script — *Camera shows X. User does Y. Screen reacts with Z.* If you cannot write it without the verbs *"allows"*, *"enables"*, *"lets users"*, or *"users can"*, the demo moment is not concrete enough — go back to ideate.

```
0:00 — Camera shows: {{what's on screen at second 0}}
0:02 — User does: {{the single action — click, scroll, speak, type}}
0:05 — Screen reacts with: {{the visible/audible response — motion, color, sound, generated content}}
0:08 — End frame: {{the still that lingers in the judge's memory}}
```

If this clip fails at judging time, the whole project fails. Build this FIRST.

